  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "扮公伙仔"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>雁&nbsp; &nbsp; 翎</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">我是一个庄跤囡仔。細漢ê時，阮兩姊妹仔一日到暗lóng mā leh扮公伙仔。阿公khioh一个烏色ê害鼎hōo--阮，koh用柴kā阮創兩枝假菜刀；阿媽提幾若个破鍋仔、一枝舊煎匙送--阮；就án-ne生，阮sńg煮食ê家私lóng tshuân好勢--ah。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span></span></p><a name='more'></a><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">門口埕hit排竹仔跤是阮扮公伙仔ê好所在，兩个囡仔sù常tī hia sńg kah歡頭喜面：一睏仔挽樹葉仔、竹心來炒菜，一睏仔phâng水、khioh石頭來kûn湯，一睏仔koh去tshuah榕仔鬚來做麵線……一桌tshenn-tshau ê料理煮好，就hiu阿公阿媽鬥陣來hōo阮請。阿公tng tī田--裡作穡貧惰tshap--阮。阿媽koh-khah無閒mā ài kā手頭khang-khuè放--leh，緊來kā阮phâng場，若無，khah停仔兩姊妹仔起無空就tī hia iau飽吵，伊tsiah m̄敢領教！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">一日阿公khah早煞工，下晡4點外就tńg來歇睏順suà陪阮同齊tshit-thô。拄好阮又koh學總舖師leh無閒煮食，妹仔一下歡喜到tè suah講beh刣豬公請人客。「Lán兜kan-na飼雞kap鴨，哪有豬thang好刣？」「我來！Hia m̄是有一隻烏豬仔……」Tsit个天才妹仔竟然攑伊ê柴菜刀去jiok阿祖hit隻烏貓仔，jiok--著ê時看伊一刀tuì貓仔身軀kā phut--落-去，「iaunn」一聲，烏貓仔無按怎，走kánn-ná飛--leh，伊ê菜刀suah來斷做兩半。妹仔隨放聲哭，阿媽就罵阿公：「Tsiah hân-bān！創kah tsit款àu古菜刀……」阿公替家己huah冤枉：「菜刀是hōo人切菜--ê，beh刣豬ài用豬刀tsiah tio̍h！」</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">尾--à khah大漢--ah，阿爸阿母beh接阮來台北讀冊，妹仔講ài kā tsia-ê tshit-thô-mi̍h仔做伙紮來去；我就講：「Mài gōng--ah，阿母ê秀梳仔kám ē答應？」伊想來想去想著一个好辦法：「阿媽，烏鼎hām菜刀緊kā阮款hōo好勢，明仔載beh叫阿公tshuā阮提來去阿仁--ā hia寄囥。」阿仁--ā tī街仔口開kám仔店，tiānn-tiānn請阮食糖仔，妹仔叫是伊hām阮真有交情。「阿媽kā lín收--起-來好--無？」「Bē-sái！有囡仔來，ē hōo人偷khe̍h--去，阿仁--ā hia有人顧店khah安全。」</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">前幾年仔阮tńg庄跤培墓，tshuā囡仔去阿仁--ā店--裡買涼水，頭毛喙鬚白ê阿仁--ā koh ē記得tsit件代誌，問妹仔講：「Lín ê烏鼎hām菜刀tshuân好--未？」妹仔是見笑kah beh死，講後擺無愛koh kā伊交關--lah！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tsiok懷念囡仔時代ê日子，逐工無煩無惱招妹仔來扮公伙仔，阿公阿媽kā阮惜命命，也有hia-ê tsiânn心適ê厝邊兜。Tsit-má逐个lóng老--ah，阿公阿媽mā過身--去，m̄-koh hia-ê美好ê往事ē永遠變做阮頭殼內上suí ê記憶。</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><span></span><span><!--more--></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhICH6PKvMLrn7HCzqxyHB4thnkyu3N4dhQyChaZ0Jw8nZpmG-IShERP458nhEzRz8NVzvYv1h6_QglYDWo4ivVFE_hHvbapKWYnIBenOfWiEtysMnBzi1aczE-I7TDDcNDAR2nwYcFm2JjtNzo1fU1ktHjyZsMeUUNMQVA9YUjcMDMIoPAAdRRvB2WsTzj/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1353%E6%9C%9F_19.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhICH6PKvMLrn7HCzqxyHB4thnkyu3N4dhQyChaZ0Jw8nZpmG-IShERP458nhEzRz8NVzvYv1h6_QglYDWo4ivVFE_hHvbapKWYnIBenOfWiEtysMnBzi1aczE-I7TDDcNDAR2nwYcFm2JjtNzo1fU1ktHjyZsMeUUNMQVA9YUjcMDMIoPAAdRRvB2WsTzj/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1353%E6%9C%9F_19.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi-N2VJFXC-e2OcB6iOQxSM-ERvvsr_4zVpbDzaRR1gwyAHw4VXOf6SiT_2U_2yK7M-1fDAaZDZ39ex-b306HREqIyeiL-Ni9wtriVP2Z714jNfp-LY7bjc0iNbeHX3pPnynda5he2dcrL0xJkvfBSvt3Z8l7eCxSQHINPC7rDKLGdk-WEdeCLejgVX7cSi/s3036/%E6%8A%BD%E6%8F%9B_%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%